  <figcaption><span class="figure-title">The preregistered test, on two models.</span>
  Filled dots are Llama-3.1-8B, hollow dots Qwen2.5-7B. Artifact tactics change what kind of thing the
  answer is; permission tactics argue that the model should comply. Artifact went 5 of 6 on both models,
  permission 0 of 4 on both. The registered gap between the family means held on both: 0.193 on Llama,
  0.131 on Qwen. Hover a row for the wrapper that was used. The one artifact failure, <em>recipe</em>, is
  the frame-fit problem — a recipe has nothing to do with the requests it was applied to.</figcaption>
